{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 对部分心理动机和转折原因压缩较多，尤其 S07、S11，Y 更清楚地解释了他为什么犹豫，以及怎样形成新的打算。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的短句、重点加亮和按音乐段落出现的感受提示，更适合边听边扫，能迅速抓住每段的情绪核心，而且对旋律、节奏、音型和声音变化的描写明显更细。Y 的优势是心理因果交代得更充分，人物为什么反复、前后如何转变更容易理解；但长句较多，部分音乐感受也被概括掉了。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选 X，它让人既能跟上故事，也能在听音乐时捕捉到更多具体变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3185335a-3770-4c5b-bb58-47cc6fdf83cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T212657336551Z", "elapsed_seconds": 94.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:28:32.330697+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9d1462b5a8b86763ccaa5be27c94ae6fece68122b08dab62963d85ef52ab8610", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3